---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const gumroadUrl = 'https://cooperhawk64.gumroad.com/l/abqkkx';
const payhipUrl = 'https://payhip.com/b/su2J3';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Productivity Aesthetic Daily Planning Printable"
  description="A calm, aesthetic daily planning system that doesn't turn productivity into a performance — undated pages, a hard 3-priority cap, and a self-care check-in with no score to chase."
  canonical="/productivity-aesthetic-daily-planning"
  ogImage="/images/adhd-planner-bundle/page02-daily-planner-preview.png"
>
  <Header />

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div>
        <span class="hero-badge">Aesthetic · Printable · Instant Download</span>
        <h1>Daily planning that feels calm, not like a performance</h1>
        <p class="tagline">Aesthetic doesn't have to mean fragile — these pages hold up to a real messy week. Soft layouts, a hard cap of three priorities a day, and a self-care check-in that isn't another score to chase.</p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href={gumroadUrl} rel="nofollow" onclick="window.pintrk && pintrk('track', 'checkout', {value: 17.99, currency: 'USD'})">Get it on Gumroad — $17.99</a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={payhipUrl} rel="nofollow" onclick="window.pintrk && pintrk('track', 'checkout', {value: 17.99, currency: 'USD'})">Buy on Payhip</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-image-card">
        <img src="/images/adhd-planner-bundle/page02-daily-planner-preview.png" alt="Daily planner page split into morning, afternoon and evening instead of hourly slots" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gallery">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Planning that includes how you feel, not just what's due</h2>
      <p class="lede">Real pages from the actual bundle.</p>
      <div class="gallery-grid">
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/adhd-planner-bundle/page10-selfcare-checkin-preview.png" alt="Self-care check-in page for sleep, movement, water and mood" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/adhd-planner-bundle/page06-priority-matrix-preview.png" alt="Priority matrix page sorting tasks into plan-for-it or let-it-go" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/adhd-planner-bundle/weekly-planner-page1-preview.png" alt="Weekly planner page with a top-3 priorities row and morning, afternoon, evening blocks for each day" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="philosophy">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p>Part of the same <a href="/shop/adhd-planner-bundle">full ADHD Planner Bundle</a> — including a <a href="/blog/brain-dump-page-thats-not-a-blank-box">brain dump page</a> for the thoughts that won't stay quiet. Prefer an even more stripped-down version first? Try the <a href="/minimalist-printable-planner">minimalist printable planner page</a> instead.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-band">
      <div class="price">$17.99</div>
      <p>Instant PDF download — US Letter and A4 included.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={gumroadUrl} rel="nofollow">Get it on Gumroad</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={payhipUrl} rel="nofollow">Buy on Payhip</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
